msgid "Observe rejection, borrow, cancellation and drain"
msgstr "观察拒绝、借用、取消与排空"

msgid ""
"Run this host tutorial to observe the real public SPI API against a Native "
"provider. It demonstrates software ownership and failure paths, not physical"
" DMA timing. The complete executable fixture is the maintained GoogleTest "
"target; its model controls stand in for external IRQ and wire progress only."
" GoogleTest/GoogleMock and C++17 are host-only; production firmware remains "
"C11."
msgstr ""
"执行本主机教程，观察真实公共 SPI API 与 Native 提供者的行为。它说明软件所有权和失败路径，不建立物理 DMA "
"时序。完整可执行夹具是维护中的 GoogleTest 目标；模型控制仅替代外部 IRQ 与线上进度。GoogleTest/GoogleMock 和 "
"C++17 仅用于主机；生产固件保持 C11。"

msgid ""
"First obtain the [fixed source and recursive dependencies](../guides/source-"
"checkout.md). Keep the source revision with your fresh execution reports."
msgstr "先取得[固定源码与递归依赖](../guides/source-checkout.md)。将源码版本与新的执行报告一起保留。"

msgid "Build and run the complete fixtures"
msgstr "构建并运行完整夹具"

msgid ""
"From the repository root, with host tools and pinned dependencies available:"
msgstr "从仓库根目录执行，先具备主机工具和锁定依赖："

msgid ""
"Run each binary without a filter and retain fresh XML in a new directory:"
msgstr "不加过滤器运行每个可执行文件，将新生成的 XML 保存在新目录："

msgid ""
"All three commands must exit zero and report passing, nonzero test counts. "
"These complete target executions are a tutorial scope, not the all-target "
"commit TDD qualification. Remove the tutorial directory only after retaining"
" needed reports."
msgstr ""
"三个命令都必须退出零，并报告非零的通过用例数。这些完整目标执行属于教程范围，不是全部目标的 commit TDD 资格。保留所需报告后才能删除教程目录。"

msgid "Follow the normal and rejected admission path"
msgstr "观察正常准入与拒绝路径"

msgid ""
"Complete maintained test: same-controller rejection and wire completion."
msgstr "完整维护测试：同控制器拒绝与线上完成。"

msgid ""
"The first endpoint accepts its request. The caller keeps the request and "
"buffers alive. The second endpoint returns `NX_ERROR_BUSY` while its request"
" stays READY; that rejection retains no borrow. Stepping payload transfer "
"does not publish SETTLED before the simulated wire-completion step. Service "
"and IRQ progress remain explicit; a waiting client cannot assume a hidden "
"worker."
msgstr ""
"第一个端点接受请求，调用方保持请求和缓冲区有效。第二个端点返回 `NX_ERROR_BUSY`，其请求仍为 "
"READY；该拒绝不保留借用。模拟载荷传输推进后，在模拟线上完成步骤之前不会发布 SETTLED。Service 与 IRQ "
"进度保持显式；等待客户端不能假设存在隐藏执行任务。"

msgid "Follow cancellation and failed drain"
msgstr "观察取消与失败排空"

msgid ""
"Complete maintained cancellation fixture; held drain retains the borrow."
msgstr "完整维护取消夹具；保持排空阻塞时保留借用。"

msgid ""
"Cancel requests termination. With drain deliberately held, the request "
"becomes QUARANTINED, stop returns BUSY and prepare rejects reuse. The model "
"then supplies actual drain progress; service publishes SETTLED and result "
"observation exposes the cancelled result and transferred prefix. Removing "
"the model hold is a test control, not a generic production recovery API."
msgstr ""
"Cancel 请求终止。故意保持排空阻塞时，请求进入 QUARANTINED，停止返回 BUSY，prepare "
"拒绝复用。随后模型提供实际排空进度，service 发布 SETTLED，结果观察提供取消结果与已传输前缀。解除模型阻塞是测试控制，不是通用生产恢复 "
"API。"

msgid ""
"The generated factory fixture also tests platform stop with a quarantined "
"UART borrow. The UART owner fixture checks rejected submissions and retained"
" payload against GoogleMock dependency ports. Read "
"[ownership](../explanation/ownership.md) before copying request storage into"
" an application."
msgstr ""
"生成的 factory 夹具也测试持有隔离 UART 借用时的平台停止。UART owner 夹具通过 GoogleMock "
"依赖端口检查拒绝提交和载荷保留。将请求存储移入应用前先阅读[所有权](../explanation/ownership.md)。"

msgid ""
"![Request admission, drain, quarantine and final "
"settlement](../assets/diagrams/request-lifecycle.svg)"
msgstr "![请求准入、排空、隔离与最终结束](../assets/diagrams/request-lifecycle.svg)"

msgid "Request admission, drain, quarantine and final settlement"
msgstr "请求准入、排空、隔离与最终结束"

msgid ""
"FIG-06 expresses current Core helper transitions with provider proof "
"obligations. The [I/O lifecycle matrix](../design/io-lifecycle-matrix.md) "
"limits what these models establish. IRQ hints, stable slot epochs, observer "
"detach and join require the [OS shutdown guide](../guides/os-shutdown.md)."
msgstr ""
"FIG-06 表示当前 Core 辅助函数转移和提供者的证明义务。[I/O 生命周期矩阵](../design/io-lifecycle-"
"matrix.md)限定模型建立的范围。IRQ 提示、稳定槽 epoch、观察者 detach 和 join 需遵循 [OS "
"停机指南](../guides/os-shutdown.md)。"
